1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,882
Murabbiy aniqlandi!

2
00:00:01,902 --> 00:00:05,437
Eng ko'p layk — hayitboyev nuqta yetmish olti!

3
00:00:05,457 --> 00:00:06,518
Tabriklaymiz!

4
00:00:06,538 --> 00:00:09,513
Murabbiyning birinchi qarori — sinov o'yini!

5
00:00:09,533 --> 00:00:13,867
Sinov jamoasiga kirish uchun: pozitsiyangiz va ismingizni yozing.

6
00:00:13,887 --> 00:00:14,823
Aytgancha...

7
00:00:14,843 --> 00:00:17,916
eng faol o'yinchi asosiy jamoaga o'tishi mumkin.

8
00:00:17,936 --> 00:00:20,585
Obuna bo'ling, o'yin boshlanmoqda!

